[I] Next Generation IRC Daemon

[T] ngIRCd is a free, portable and lightweight Internet Relay Chat server
[T] for small or private networks. It is easy to configure, can run as a
[T] single node or as part of a network of ngIRCd servers, and supports IPv6
[T] and SSL/TLS.

[U] https://ngircd.barton.de/

